      "message": "fix(build): the gate reports VOID when the checkout moves during a run\n\ncargo xtask gate reads HEAD and git status --porcelain at start, before each\nstep and at the end. A change prints a VOID line naming what moved and exits 1\nwith no verdict. Detection only: no lock, no hook. AGENTS.md and work-issue say\na worktree agent never switches, pulls, merges or resets in the main checkout.\n\nPROCESS_VERSION 30: xtask and the process docs changed.\n\nFixes #1201\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
